    "status": "accepted",
    "status_raw": "Accepted",
    "text": "# Allow order_controller to use order_repository directly\n\n* Status: Accepted\n* Date: 2025-04-17\n\n## Context and Problem Statement\n\nThe layering rule R005 normally forbids this dependency, but bulk exports would otherwise load the full result set into memory.\n\n## Decision Outcome\n\nWe accept that `order_controller` will use `order_repository` directly, bypassing rule R005. The exception is permanent and applies only to this module.\n\n### Consequences\n\nNo other module is covered by this exception.\n",
    "title": "Allow order_controller to use order_repository directly"
   }
